# CelebBoard — Product Roadmap to Commercialization

**Timeline:** 8 weeks to first paying customer
**Team:** Backend Dev (BD) · Marketing/Frontend (MF)
**Date:** March 2026

---

## Launch Definition

A customer can: sign up → connect HubSpot via OAuth → see their live CRM data on a TV → celebrations fire automatically when deals close. The marketing site drives inbound with comparison pages and SEO content. Onboarding is white-glove (no Stripe, no self-serve setup wizard).

