## Epic 9: Comparison Pages & SEO Content
**Owner:** MF · **Weeks 3-7** · **Priority: 🔴 Critical**

Comparison pages are the highest-intent content CelebBoard can publish. Someone searching "Geckoboard alternative" is ready to buy.

**Stories:**

- **Comparison page template** — Reusable component with: hero, side-by-side feature table, what competitor does well, where it falls short, how CelebBoard differs, pricing comparison, who should choose what, FAQ with JSON-LD schema. Bilingual (EN + FR).

- **7 comparison pages** (in priority order):
  1. CelebBoard vs Geckoboard — "Data vs. Energy"
  2. CelebBoard vs Hoopla — "The TV celebration platform Hoopla users have been searching for"
  3. CelebBoard vs SalesScreen — "All the celebration. None of the complexity."
  4. CelebBoard vs Spinify — "Your team doesn't need 20 game mechanics."
  5. CelebBoard vs Plecto — "A dashboard your team actually watches."
  6. CelebBoard vs Fugo — "Purpose-built for celebrations, not signage."
  7. CelebBoard vs Ambition — "Enterprise features. Startup simplicity."

- **Pillar page: "What is Team Celebration Software?"** — ~3,000 words, category-defining content. Primary SEO asset.

- **3-4 blog posts** (bilingual .mdx):
  - "7 Ways to Celebrate Sales Wins Without Gamification" (top-funnel)
  - "The Real Cost of Sales Gamification Software" (mid-funnel)
  - "Why Your Office TV Should Do More Than Show Charts" (top-funnel)
  - "How to Set Up a Team Celebration Display in 10 Minutes" (tutorial)

- **Integration landing page: /integrations/hubspot** — Feature page optimized for "HubSpot TV dashboard" keyword.

- **Product screenshots & demo assets** — Capture polished screens from seeded admin + display. Process in Shots.so. Create 2-3 celebration demo GIFs/videos from demo org.

- **Homepage refresh** — Replace placeholder mockups with real screenshots. Add comparison page links to nav. Working demo display link.

- **SEO verification** — Structured data testing, hreflang validation, sitemap to GSC, OG images on all pages.

**Done when:** 7 comparison pages + 1 pillar page + 3-4 blog posts + HubSpot integration page are live and indexed. Homepage shows real product screenshots and a demo link.

