## Epic 10: Launch Prep
**Owner:** Both · **Weeks 7-8** · **Priority: 🔴 Critical**

Everything needed to confidently onboard the first paying customer.

**Stories:**

- **End-to-end integration test** (BD) — Fresh signup → connect HubSpot → configure trigger → fire test webhook → see celebration on display. Verify the full happy path.

- **Stress test** (BD) — 50 rapid webhooks in 60 seconds. Verify queue, display, and DB handle it.

- **Security review** (BD) — RLS on all tables, API routes audited for auth bypass, display token entropy check.

- **Performance audit** (BD) — Lighthouse 90+ on marketing pages. Display page memory profiling. API response time baseline.

- **Production deployment** (BD) — Env vars, DNS, Supabase production project, Vercel production config.

- **API docs for generic webhook** (BD) — What to send, what headers, payload format, examples. Publishable page or PDF.

- **White-glove onboarding script** (MF) — Step-by-step document: how to onboard a customer in 30 minutes. What to click, what to explain, common questions.

- **Marketplace & review listings** (MF) — G2 profile, Capterra profile, HubSpot App Marketplace application.

- **Launch announcement** (MF) — Product Hunt listing copy, LinkedIn posts, email to waitlist.

- **Cross-browser/device testing** (MF) — Marketing on mobile/tablet, admin on Chrome/Firefox/Safari, display on Chrome/Edge.

**Done when:** Confident that a real customer can be onboarded in 30 minutes, their TV display runs reliably, and the marketing site is ready for inbound traffic.

