## Risk Register

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| HubSpot OAuth bugs persist past Week 1 | Blocks entire backend | Timebox to 3 days; fallback to manual API key entry |
| GA4 Google Cloud Console complexity | Delays GA4 | GA4 is nice-to-have; can launch without it |
| Figma design takes longer than 1 week | Delays display build | Start with dashboard only; overlay design can overlap with dashboard build |
| Comparison pages don't rank quickly | Low inbound | Supplement with LinkedIn outreach and direct prospecting |
| First customer's HubSpot has unexpected schema | Broken triggers | Robust error handling in field mapping; admin shows mapping health |
| TV display crashes after hours | Erodes trust | Week 7 soak test; Sentry alerts; auto-recovery |

